Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.00,0:01:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,法国里维埃拉的性产业归我管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the prostitution on French Riviera belongs to me.
