Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.77,0:01:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,好姑娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.98,0:02:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你想为我工作吗？- 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You wanna work for me? - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.99,0:02:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.20,0:02:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 姑娘们 去工作吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, girls. Get to work.
