Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.58,0:02:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 安娜？- 是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Anna? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.37,0:03:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是我 都搞定了 我们都准备好了今晚的行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's me. It's done. We're all ready for tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.54,0:03:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一切都安排好了 - 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Everything's set up. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.34,0:03:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 安娜？- 说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Anna? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.05,0:03:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定你要这么做？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure you want to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.38,0:03:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道的 现在取消还不晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can still cancel everything, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.55,0:03:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,在我完全搞定之前我不能停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't stop until I get all the way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.85,0:03:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 我们按计划进行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. We'll do as we planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.10,0:03:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.14,0:03:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我也爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.21,0:04:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,科技发展的太快了 对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Technology moves so fast, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.84,0:04:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 当你认为他们 做不了什么的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, as soon as you think they can't come up with something,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.51,0:04:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就发明了其它的东西替代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they come up with something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.18,0:04:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,很快车子就能自动驾驶了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll be able to drive itself soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.22,0:04:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,让你怀疑我这样的人 是不是要淘汰了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Makes you wonder if guys like me will be out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.23,0:04:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,但是人们总是需要我这样的人 对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But people always need guys like me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.77,0:04:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,把钥匙交出来 小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hand over the keys, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.03,0:04:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,但是钥匙没有任何用处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the keys won't do you any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.07,0:04:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你得知道 这辆车只能靠 驾驶员的指纹启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, this car only starts with the driver's unique fingerprints
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.61,0:04:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,只能由我开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when I grip the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.24,0:04:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.45,0:05:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你很聪明 说话尖刻 我要给你教训\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're smart and sharp. I'm gonna cut you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.25,0:05:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,给我钥匙 然后滚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gimme the keys and blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.62,0:05:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.51,0:05:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.33,0:05:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你听着 事情这么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, here's how we're going to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.75,0:05:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,手放在方向盘上 你开车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put your hands on that wheel, and drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.92,0:05:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那可不是好计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not a very good plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.09,0:05:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.84,0:05:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你会让我迟到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna make me late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.60,0:06:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我讨厌迟到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I hate being late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.27,0:06:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过那不是好计划…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you that wasn't a good plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.64,0:07:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你迟到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.72,0:07:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,只迟到了38秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm 38 seconds late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.80,0:07:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,提前有很多程度 而迟到只有一种程度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's several degrees of early and only one degree of late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.56,0:07:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,就是太迟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.23,0:07:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 如何？- 什么如何？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So? - So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.31,0:07:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,事情怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So how'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.48,0:07:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为你不会问问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you didn't ask questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.15,0:07:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我在工作的时候不会问问题 但这是捎带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't ask questions when I'm on a job, but this is a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.74,0:07:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Went okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.20,0:07:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那么你拿到了多少？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So how much did you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.49,0:07:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,七百九十一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}791.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.75,0:07:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,791000美金？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}791,000?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.71,0:07:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来你的收获可不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That sounds like you did better than okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.25,0:07:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,791欧元 那就是我从现在起的退休金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}791 euros. That's my pension from here on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.34,0:07:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,每月791欧元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}791 euros a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.22,0:07:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.64,0:08:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,退休快乐 老爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy retirement, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.85,0:08:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,三十年来一直领着可观的薪水 没有时间去花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thirty-odd years of making good money and not a moment to spend it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.18,0:08:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在有的是时间 还有足够的钱去花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I've got all the time in the world and not enough money to spend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.81,0:08:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,要我说 这个体制糟透了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you ask me, the system's broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.11,0:08:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,鸭肝泥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pate de canard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.36,0:08:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得可以吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.57,0:08:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,吃了之后告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you once I taste it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.03,0:08:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你该考虑买一辆自己的车了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you should think about getting a car of your own, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.45,0:08:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我有自己的车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have my own car.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.53,0:08:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那你就应该考虑开它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then maybe you should think about using it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.16,0:08:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我很享受我们一起度过的品质时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I enjoy our quality time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.12,0:08:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该知道我是靠开车为生的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do realize I sit in traffic for a living.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.99,0:08:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你是做那个的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that what you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.08,0:08:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我来这里是为接近你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came here to be closer to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.79,0:08:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,英国还不够近吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And England wasn't close enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.29,0:08:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你妈妈被葬在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mother's buried there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.67,0:08:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,对我而言 那地方现在就像个墓地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The island is like a cemetery to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.38,0:08:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸 拜托你别太入戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy on the drama, Dad, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.97,0:08:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你得答应我以后可别把我埋地下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just promise me you won't stick me in the ground. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.22,0:08:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你母亲是很好的天主教徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mother was a good Catholic and everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.59,0:08:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但是当我死了之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but when it comes my time to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.51,0:08:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,只要把我火化 然后喂鱼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just throw me on the fire and feed me to the fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.18,0:08:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你要接电话吗 儿子？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gonna get that, Junior?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.69,0:08:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我开车的时候不用手机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't use the phone while I'm driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.08,0:09:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 吉娜 是我 我们都在等你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Gina, it's me. We're all waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.30,0:09:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,请快点来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.46,0:09:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,她会来的 别担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's gonna come. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.38,0:09:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你能相信这些姑娘吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you believe these girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.18,0:09:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,她们表达感谢的方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is how they show their appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.97,0:09:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,就是约会的时候迟到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By being late for an appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.64,0:09:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你没听我说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.35,0:09:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这很粗鲁 如果我是顾客呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's rude. What if I was a client?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.77,0:09:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那她就不会迟到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She wouldn't be late then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.48,0:09:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,但是对于见我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But to meet me,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.69,0:09:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这个给她钱的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the man who puts the money in her pockets
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.61,0:09:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,为她支付医疗费的人 她选择了迟到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and pays her medical bills, she's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.32,0:09:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定是她来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure that's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.53,0:09:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,最好是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It better be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.66,0:09:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗨 宝贝 - 抱歉 抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, baby. - Sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.58,0:09:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都很担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone was worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.71,0:09:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 这个地方的交通太糟了 我的手机也没电了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, traffic in this town's a nightmare and my cell phone died.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.50,0:09:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,当我今晚见到卡拉索夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, when I see Karasov tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.59,0:10:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我会让他给你配个司机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will tell him to get you a driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.21,0:10:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 既然我们都到了 我们就开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, that we are all here, let's get this party going.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.93,0:10:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是这么想的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My sentiments exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.60,0:10:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.58,0:10:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.04,0:10:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,她是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.13,0:10:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 她自己干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. She was independent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.63,0:10:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,她死于吸毒过量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She died of a hero OD.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.30,0:10:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你拿到项链了？- 是的 做你的事去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You got the necklace? - Yes. Do your thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.22,0:10:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.82,0:11:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 乔 都好了吗？- 好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Qiao, ready? - Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.29,0:11:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,人人为我 我为人人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All for one, one for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.67,0:11:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.09,0:11:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 你有什么打算？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what's your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.55,0:11:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,什么打算？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My plan for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.88,0:11:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,未来的打算 老爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the future, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.22,0:11:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定有打算 你总是有打算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must have a plan. You always have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.81,0:11:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我本来想把这个作为惊喜 但既然你问了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I was gonna keep it as a surprise, but since you asked,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.06,0:11:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我在考虑买那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been thinking about buying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.31,0:11:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,对于领着工人退休金的人来说 这是条不错的渔船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a nice fishing boat for a guy with a worker's pension.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.73,0:11:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我的积蓄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been saving for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.28,0:11:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我想你也很想旅行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I think you miss to travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.57,0:11:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 你之前就去过一些很不错的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, you've been in some pretty wild places in your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.99,0:11:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,80年代的德国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Germany in the '80s,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.74,0:11:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,90年代的哥伦比亚 还有中东\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colombia in the '90s, Middle East since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.70,0:11:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,依云水是个国际品牌 而我是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evian is a global brand, and I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.37,0:11:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,销售代表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Top sales rep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.49,0:11:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.58,0:11:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我知道 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I know. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.29,0:12:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,三十年来作为水务公司的销售\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thirty-odd years working as a rep for a water company,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.42,0:12:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你总是出现在那些最危险的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you always seem to find yourself in the most dangerous places,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.84,0:12:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,还恰好是关键时期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the most defining moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.01,0:12:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,经历了柏林墙事件 还有制药企业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fall of the Berlin Wall, collapse of the Medellin cartel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.09,0:12:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还有塔利班 - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And the Taliban... - Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.51,0:12:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,别忘了塔利班\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't forget the Taliban.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.97,0:12:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信费鲁杰的人很喜欢依云水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bet they like Evian in Fallujah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.97,0:12:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,实际上 他们不太喜欢苏打水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, they don't really care for sparkling water.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.97,0:12:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他们更喜欢自来水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They do prefer the flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.52,0:12:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.06,0:12:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,儿子 我认为你对于我的谋生方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Junior, I don't think you have one ounce of wiggle room
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.44,0:12:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,没有任何的评价权利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to moralize to me about how I earn my living.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.07,0:12:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是什么意思？- 没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And what you mean by that? - Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.69,0:12:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你的客户都是些影星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure all your clients are movie stars,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.36,0:12:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,企业老板 达官贵人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}captains of industry, dignitaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.49,0:12:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但我不会问 他们也不会说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't ask, they don't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.78,0:12:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该知道些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That should tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.11,0:12:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,看啊 匿名女士又来电了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, look, um, Miss Unknown is calling again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.04,0:12:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你为何认为这个人是个女的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what would make you think that "Unknown" is a Miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.54,0:12:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是猜猜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just guessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.21,0:12:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.38,0:12:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你是"玩命速递"？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this the Transporter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.34,0:12:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那得看你是谁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That depends who this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.34,0:12:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,希望是你的下一个雇主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hopefully, your next employer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.47,0:12:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我不通过电话谈交易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't do business over the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.51,0:12:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那就明天吧 下午两点 马杰斯酒店餐厅见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow then. 2:00 p.m. at the bar at the Majestic hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.18,0:13:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么知道哪个人是你？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How will I know who you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.56,0:13:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.98,0:13:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 在我们那个年代 如果你想喝咖啡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, in my day, when you wanted to make a cup of coffee
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.19,0:13:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你只需要烧水和磨咖啡豆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you just had to boil the water and strain the grinds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.95,0:13:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,现在还得要博士学位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now it seems like you need a PhD.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.20,0:13:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 你是个博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, you have a PhD.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.03,0:13:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那是榨汁机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a juicer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.25,0:13:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你这家里需要个女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need a woman around the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.13,0:14:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,里奥？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leo?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.80,0:14:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.05,0:14:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们合作多久了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since when we work together?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.63,0:14:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,12年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twelve years.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.22,0:14:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,十五年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fifteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.34,0:14:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,十五年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fifteen years.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.18,0:14:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是不相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You still don't trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.47,0:14:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.77,0:14:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果是涉及到女人的事情 我喜欢慢慢来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But when it comes to girls, I'd like to take my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.19,0:14:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.73,0:14:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那么尤里… - 嗯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And Yuri... - Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.98,0:14:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在真的住在自己的国度？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it true that you live in your plane now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.28,0:14:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 没有海关 没有税收 自由的像个鸟儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, no customs, no taxes, free like a bird, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.41,0:14:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等等 阿卡迪？- 现在不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hold on. Arkady? - Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.95,0:14:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,出事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's been an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.13,0:14:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Da.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.97,0:15:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说是因为电气故障\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're calling it an electrical malfunction.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.02,0:15:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他的妻子指认出了尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His wife identified the bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.64,0:15:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那叫我来干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then what am I doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.14,0:15:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他是你的会计 难道不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was your accountant, was he not?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.56,0:15:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的 也是其他很多人的会计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mine and a lot of other people's.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.06,0:15:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你有把他们都找来看吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you ask all of them to come down here to see his body?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.57,0:15:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是叫你来看他的尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't ask you to come here to see his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.74,0:15:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,而是叫你来看她的尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I asked you to come here to see hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.99,0:15:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,她是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.20,0:15:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我还希望你告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was hoping you might tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.41,0:15:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,她显然是你的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She appears to be one of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.87,0:15:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白你在说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.25,0:15:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这项链不是什么秘密 卡拉索夫先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Coeur Brise is hardly a secret, Mr. Karasov.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.00,0:15:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,即使是我部门的人员 也和你的"女主人"打过交道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even men in my own department have spent time with your "hostesses."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.05,0:15:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你是那么叫她们的 对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is what you call them, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.72,0:15:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我是个守法的生意人 警官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a legitimate businessman, Inspector.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.72,0:15:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我手下有很多人为我工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a lot of people who work for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.18,0:15:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我不可能全认识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I can't possibly account for all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.64,0:15:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这我理解 但我不明白为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course not. Though what I can't quite figure
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.10,0:15:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,她们中有人要杀你的会计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is why one of them would want to kill your accountant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.69,0:15:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚才不是说 那是因为电气故障吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you said this was an electrical accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.73,0:15:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那是酒店的说法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is what the hotel is saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.23,0:15:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,她们没必要看到我们从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They haven't had the benefit of seeing the .9mm slugs
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.86,0:15:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,死者脑中取出的9毫米子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we pulled from their heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.45,0:16:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们是被枪杀的？- 近距离射击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They were shot? - At close range.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.32,0:16:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,嫌疑人只不过想用火来掩盖痕迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suspect whomever did this started the fire to cover their tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.53,0:16:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,而你认为我与此有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you think I had something to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.20,0:16:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想调查清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to be perfectly clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.46,0:16:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人指控你任何事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one is accusing you of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.58,0:16:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.25,0:16:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,因为如果那样的话 你最好多带点人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause if you ever do, you better come with more men.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.80,0:16:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你认为那些95年的非洲人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think the West Africans from '95
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.60,0:16:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,想要重新夺回地盘？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are trying to get back into the skin game?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.35,0:16:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们没那么聪明 - 那是谁干的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They're too smart for that. - Who is then?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.64,0:16:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 但只要我知道是谁干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. But when I find out who they are,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.69,0:16:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他们肯定会后悔在这世上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they'll wish they were someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.74,0:16:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You called me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.24,0:16:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道是我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you know it was me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.70,0:16:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你说过你只有一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said you'd be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.58,0:16:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,她就不是一个人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, she's alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.79,0:16:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,她还带着一条狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, she has a dog with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.87,0:16:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,养狗的人一般会说他们带着狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dog people usually say they're with their dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.04,0:16:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我很高兴你能来见我 我是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I appreciate you coming to meet me. I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.50,0:16:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不需要名字 - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No names. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.67,0:16:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那是第一条规则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the first rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.76,0:17:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这样如果有人问起我你是谁 我就能说不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone asks me who you are, I have plausible deniability.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.05,0:17:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,对我们都有好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better for me, better for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.59,0:17:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说你就是这样的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard you were like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.01,0:17:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,谁说的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heard from whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.51,0:17:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,之前和你合作过的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone you worked with previously
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.31,0:17:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,根据你的第一条规矩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whose name would presumably mean nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.81,0:17:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他的名字不重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}given your first rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.98,0:17:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你学得很快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a quick study.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.60,0:17:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,还有什么我需要知道的规矩？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are there any other rules I need to know about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.40,0:17:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦条件和要求谈妥了 就不能改变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once the deal is made, the deal never changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.44,0:17:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,如果改变 我就不干了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You change the deal, I drive away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.86,0:17:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你只要负责送一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The deal is for one passenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.49,0:17:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你接我上车 然后送我下车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You pick me up, drop me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.82,0:17:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你的威士忌 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your whiskey, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.66,0:17:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有行李吗？- 两个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Any packages? - Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.58,0:17:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 多重？- 总共104公斤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Weight? - 104 kilos in total.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.04,0:17:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,有问题吗？我听说你能送任何东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that a problem? I was told that you can transport anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.38,0:17:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,只要我不知道是什么就行 那是最后的规矩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As long as I don't know what it is. That's the last rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.59,0:17:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,那不重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plausible deniability.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.30,0:17:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,什么时候？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When's the pick up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.10,0:17:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚五点 蒙特卡洛的摩纳哥银行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonight. 5:00 p.m. Banque de Monaco in Monte Carlo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.18,0:17:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,只有三个小时了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's in three hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.98,0:17:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你难道要午睡吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to take a nap?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.74,0:18:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,5:01我就走了 明白吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}5:01 then I'm gone, clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.65,0:18:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.32,0:18:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我之前的雇主应该说过我的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gather my previous employer mentioned my...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.20,0:18:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 你的费用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course. Your fee.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.25,0:18:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,先付一半 事成之后一半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Half now, half upon delivery.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.37,0:18:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我很会遵守规矩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm good at following the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.42,0:18:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.43,0:18:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,如果一切顺利 也许我们将来还能合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All goes well, perhaps we'll work together again in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.31,0:18:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们先别说的太早\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's not get ahead of ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.24,0:18:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是我 他走了 你可以开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's me. He left. You can proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.91,0:18:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.04,0:18:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,有问题吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.12,0:18:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不 这可是2005年产的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's just that it's a Chateau Cheval Blanc
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.08,0:18:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,限量葡萄酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the 2005 vintage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.38,0:19:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 上面写了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, it says so on the label.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.04,0:19:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,它卖900欧元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's 900 euros.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.13,0:19:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的吗？- 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Really? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.59,0:19:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,900欧元？噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}900... 900 euros? Oop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.80,0:19:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我可以为你推荐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps I can point you toward an excellent,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.06,0:19:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,一些当地产的更适合的葡萄酒？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and more affordable selection of local vineyards?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.97,0:19:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.57,0:19:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frank...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.37,0:19:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要什么吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you need anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.62,0:19:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不用了 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I'm good, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.79,0:19:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Junior.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.67,0:19:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 我想我今晚没法和你一起晚餐了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, I don't think I'm going to be able to make dinner tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.88,0:19:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我要处理一些事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couple of things I need to take care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.46,0:19:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,真遗憾 我弄了瓶好酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry to hear that. I got us a really good bottle of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.46,0:19:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 很遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.63,0:19:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那我得找些人分享它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll just have to find someone else to share it with.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.13,0:19:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来不太好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That sounds like a good plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.59,0:19:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来妙极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds like a perfect idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.01,0:19:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,需要我帮忙吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I be of some assistance?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.22,0:19:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.35,0:19:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 能帮我拿一下吗？- 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you mind holding that? - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.90,0:20:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,品味挺好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Expensive taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.09,0:21:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,发型不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.88,0:21:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直喜欢金发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always wanted to be a blonde.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.55,0:21:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,行李呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are the packages?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.13,0:21:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,她们正在路上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.89,0:21:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,十秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.61,0:21:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,五\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.99,0:21:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.83,0:21:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好的 都好了 - 搞什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, all set. - What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.87,0:21:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.62,0:21:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在有问题了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you're asking questions now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.83,0:21:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我说过一旦谈妥 就不能改变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I told you once I set the deal, the deal doesn't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.29,0:21:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,没有变 她们就是我的行李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it hasn't. Here are my two lovely packages.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.05,0:21:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,吉娜重49公斤 乔重55公斤 一共104公斤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gina, 49 kilos, Qiao, 55 kilos. 104 in all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.17,0:21:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.38,0:21:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我要取消交易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm canceling the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.51,0:21:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你得开车了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.59,0:21:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你们马上下车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out of the car. All of you. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.97,0:22:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,没人要下车 混蛋 马上开车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one is getting out of the car, asshole. Now drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.85,0:22:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你认为这是第一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think this is the first time
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.02,0:22:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,有人用枪指着我的头吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}someone's held a gun to my head?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.64,0:22:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我不这么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.77,0:22:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,但这次会是第一次有人开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's gonna be the first time someone uses it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.73,0:22:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,她真可爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, she's a charmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.36,0:22:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,安娜 有警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anna, there's a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.44,0:22:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 我们没时间再讨论了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, we don't have time to talk about this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.45,0:22:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,给他看看吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just show it to him already.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.78,0:22:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,给我看什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.41,0:22:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这样可不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No good deed goes unpunished.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.17,0:22:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你可别搞砸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't mess this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.17,0:22:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我是摩纳哥警察 请把窗户摇下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monaco Police. Vehicle documents, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.71,0:22:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,窗户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Window!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.59,0:22:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你要怎么做 弗兰克？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it gonna be, Frank?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.76,0:22:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,把窗户摇下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lower the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.97,0:22:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,从车上下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of the vehicle!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.85,0:22:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,系好安全带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seatbelts, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.67,0:23:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,让我爸爸接电话 我得马上和他谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get my father back on the phone. I want to talk to him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.92,0:23:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你会和他谈话的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be able to talk to him all you want
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.34,0:23:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你只要尽快把事情做完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as soon as the job is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.62,0:23:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.58,0:23:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这是甩掉他们的好机会 弗兰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a good time to lose them, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.46,0:23:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经尽力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm doing my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.74,0:24:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你们为什么这么做？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what's with all the getups?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.99,0:24:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,又有问题了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Questions again?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.16,0:24:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你的规矩呢？- 我没问名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What about your rules? - I don't ask names.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.12,0:24:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果有人绑架我得父亲 我就要问问题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But when someone kidnaps my father, I ask questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.14,0:24:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得你可以去拍商业片了 弗兰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess you're as good as advertised, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.93,0:24:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.28,0:24:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,各单位注意… 代号3\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All units... Code 3
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.52,0:24:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,目标是隧道里的黑色奥迪S8\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}black Audi S8 in the tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.69,0:24:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.03,0:25:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我会把你们送到目的地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, you'll be delivered as promised,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.45,0:25:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果我父亲有什么事情…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but if anything happens to my dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.87,0:25:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,别分心 亲爱的 你父亲会没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay focused, honey. Your father will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.91,0:25:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.00,0:25:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,更多警察来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More company.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.60,0:25:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.35,0:26:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,没开玩笑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You weren't kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.60,0:26:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢开玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kidding's not really my thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.79,0:26:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好的 我们走 -怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, let's go. - What are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.50,0:26:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得换车 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to change cars. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.33,0:26:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.68,0:26:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要把车留下当证据吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we going to leave the car with all the evidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.60,0:26:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.57,0:27:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,说实话 这真的很奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's really quite strange, to tell you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.95,0:27:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,地中海银行之前是被打劫过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Mediterranean Bank has been robbed before,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.83,0:27:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,但从未遇到过这样的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but never like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.21,0:27:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你来看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.80,0:27:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你会看到一个女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll see a woman right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.76,0:27:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,她自称艾琳娜·图金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She said she was Elena Turgin,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.42,0:27:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,是斯坦尼斯拉夫·图金的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wife of one Stanislav Turgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.01,0:27:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,有护照 还有他的保险箱钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had a passport and his safety deposit box's keys
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.51,0:27:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,证明是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to prove as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.64,0:27:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是艾琳娜·图金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not Elena Turgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.81,0:27:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.14,0:27:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然当时我并不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And while I didn't know that at the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.35,0:27:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,但我依然拒绝了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I refused to allow her access nonetheless.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.15,0:27:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,因为只有图金先生可以使用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As only Mr. Turgin is authorized.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.98,0:27:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,但如你所见 我被挟持了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But as you will see, I was coerced.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.32,0:27:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,第一个姑娘拿走了我的钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First girl took my keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.61,0:27:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,有了这两样东西 她就能自己打开保险箱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With both sets, she could open the security box by herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.57,0:27:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经无法阻止她了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was nothing I could do to stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.58,0:27:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,当时是谁在看守？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And who was on the security post?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.48,0:27:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.58,0:27:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,就是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Voila.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.87,0:28:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,她们看起来都是一样的 你无法区分开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They all look exactly the same. You cannot tell them apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.63,0:28:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.21,0:28:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,逃跑的司机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Getaway driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.17,0:28:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他接上了一个女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He picked the one girl up,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.63,0:28:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,然后又等了一会 接上了另外两个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then waited for the two others to arrive moments later.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.84,0:28:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,警察找到了那辆车和车里剩下的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The police found the car, what was left of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.93,0:28:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那辆车被烧过了 不过他们已经不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was set fire to, but they were already gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.85,0:28:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.89,0:28:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.15,0:28:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,喂？我马上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes? I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.36,0:28:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,是尼斯的一个探员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An inspector from Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.40,0:28:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在这等我一会儿 我马上回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you'll wait for me just a minute, I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.20,0:28:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么看？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.41,0:28:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,她们不是我们要找的女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're either our girls,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.95,0:28:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,或是某个人想让我们以为她们就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or someone who's trying to pass themselves off as our girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.62,0:28:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我会去查查存货 调查一下我们的对手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will do an inventory and check with the competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.17,0:28:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,看看是否有下落不明的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See if there's anyone unaccounted for.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.84,0:28:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,先是图金在酒店 现在又出这事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First Turgin at the hotel, and now this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.88,0:28:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 我们会查清楚是谁 并让他付出代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry. We will find who and make him pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.93,0:29:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,又迟到了 儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Late again, Junior.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.18,0:29:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,儿子？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Junior?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.43,0:29:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吧 爸爸？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're okay, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.35,0:29:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我这辈子栽在过很多混蛋手里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I've been sucker punched a lot in my time,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.48,0:29:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但从没栽在过一个女孩手里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but never by a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.27,0:29:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,站在那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.65,0:29:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你们还有多少人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many more of you are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.90,0:29:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,她是最后一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.07,0:29:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,她是爱沙尼亚 来自塔林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She is Estonian. From Tallinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.99,0:29:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以告诉你 我去过那 做过一些很胡来的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've done some funky shit in my time down there, I can tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.95,0:29:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上 他们那的伏特加非常非常棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually they've got very, very good vodka.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.12,0:30:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好极了 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's great, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.25,0:30:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我有武器 你早就知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I were armed, you'd know it by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.54,0:30:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,看来他真是你爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.21,0:30:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他没问题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.09,0:30:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们还欠你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's the rest of what we owe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.76,0:30:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.55,0:30:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,现在可以解开他了吧 我们再也不会见到你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now if you'll untie him so we can leave and never see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.30,0:30:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕我做不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.56,0:30:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们跟你们还没完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not done with you just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.02,0:30:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我真失望 我以为你们都是天生的金发女郎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm disappointed. I thought you were all natural blondes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.02,0:30:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你们想要什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.31,0:30:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我想做一笔新交易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna make a new deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.69,0:30:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 不过我没兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, but I think I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.19,0:30:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你还没听我说的条件呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You haven't heard the terms yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.90,0:30:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那一定很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This should be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.28,0:30:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,非常简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're really very simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.03,0:30:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要去拜访一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to pay someone a visit,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.95,0:30:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,而你要确保让我们抵达那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you're going to make sure that we get there and back
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.04,0:30:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,并且毫发无损地回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without any more incidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.37,0:30:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我没看出这对我来说有什么好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure I see how much of a deal that really is for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.54,0:30:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好处就是你爸爸可以活下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The deal for you is that your father gets to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.96,0:30:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我不答应 你会枪毙他？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're gonna shoot him?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.17,0:30:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,然后呢？你们还是得对付我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then what? You still have me to contend with.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.30,0:30:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你们觉得我们很蠢吗 弗兰克？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think we're stupid, Frank?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.30,0:31:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你真让我伤心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That hurts my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.52,0:31:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我要是你就不会去碰 那玩意只要一碰到你的皮肤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't do that if I were you. That touches your skin,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.48,0:31:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那和你父亲啤酒里的毒性差不多大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's nearly as toxic as the dose your father drank in his beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.95,0:31:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,头疼 呕吐 抽搐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Headaches, vomiting, convulsions,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.24,0:31:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这一切症状最终导致死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all leading up to an eventual death.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.12,0:31:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,别固执了 那毒会在12小时内发作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soup to nuts, it will kill a man in 12 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.58,0:31:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我应该现在杀了你们 你们所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should kill you right now. All of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.08,0:31:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,可以啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.46,0:31:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不过这样 你得让你爸爸跟我们一起死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you'd be killing your father along with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.59,0:31:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,而实验室起码要花12个小时 才能搞清那是什么毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will take the lab more than 12 hours to find out what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.59,0:31:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你们有解药？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you have the antidote?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.71,0:31:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你继续玩 你爸爸就能拿到解药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You play ball, your father gets it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.09,0:31:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不玩 他就死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't, he dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.55,0:31:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么知道你不会反悔？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do I know you're gonna hold up your end of the bargain?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.51,0:31:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我对你撒过谎吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I ever lie to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.14,0:31:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,另外 你也没什么选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, you don't have much of a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.62,0:32:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我找来了 所有和视频中相像的女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got all the girls that most fit the description on the video.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.42,0:32:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,她们都在这了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're all here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.63,0:32:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,都在这 除了4个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All but four.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.59,0:32:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说 她们当中一个就是酒店里身亡的女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So one of them is the dead girl from the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.30,0:32:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,其他的就是我们的内贼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the others are our thieves.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.05,0:32:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,她们从保险箱里到底拿到了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did they get from the safe deposit box?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.60,0:32:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,一些现金 珠宝 文件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some cash, jewelry, documents.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.47,0:32:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我只知道 图金没有留太多财物在那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Far as I know, Turgin didn't leave very much in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.73,0:32:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,但那个司机还是无法解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still doesn't explain the driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.27,0:32:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你认识他 不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know him, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.07,0:32:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是老相识了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We go way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.95,0:32:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 说 - 抱歉打搅您了 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Da. - Excuse me for disturbing you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.87,0:32:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 有几个警察乘着快艇过来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there are police officers approaching the yacht.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.24,0:32:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,跟他们说我在开会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell them I'm in a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.04,0:32:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,接通马索夫和尤里的电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get Imasov and Yuri on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.21,0:33:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟 这不是最糟的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All in all, it's not the worst way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.17,0:33:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直觉得我最终会被人开枪打死 在某处腐烂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always thought I'd end up being shot. Left to rot somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.51,0:33:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 但我们现在算是搭档了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, but now we're partners,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.76,0:33:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你可以告诉我 这一切是为了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}maybe you can tell me what this is all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.43,0:33:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你照我们说的做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do what we ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.81,0:33:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你会发现 越冒险 你的收获越大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you'll find that the more you venture, the more you will gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.27,0:33:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,大仲马的名言？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quoting Alexandre Dumas?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.44,0:33:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思？你是达尔达尼央\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like, what? You're Count D'Artagnan
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.86,0:33:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,而他们是"三个火枪手"？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they're the Three Musketeers?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.11,0:33:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你看过啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.78,0:33:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上 我最喜欢的台词是:"我知道你是个好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, my favorite line is, "I'm sure you're very nice,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.82,0:33:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 你如果别来烦我就更好"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you'd be nicer if you left me alone."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.74,0:33:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,没门 孩子 帮我拉上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No deal, Junior. Zip me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.79,0:33:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 别这么难过的表情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mmm. Don't look so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.34,0:33:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,24小时后 一切都将结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In 24 hours, this will all be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.18,0:33:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦你明白了我们的目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And once you understand what we're up to,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.89,0:33:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你甚至可能会喜欢它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you might even like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.41,0:34:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,就停在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.17,0:34:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来这干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.67,0:34:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你想不想演医生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you wanna play doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.01,0:34:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你为克尔效命了多长时间？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long have you been working for the Coeur Brise?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.60,0:34:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见了你的项链\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw your necklace.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.89,0:34:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,从12岁起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since I was 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.47,0:34:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你现在明白了 我是怎么认识你以前的雇主了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose now you understand how I know your former employer.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.73,0:34:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,卡拉索夫 事实上我们当时 并没拿出最佳的表现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Karasov. We didn't exactly leave things on the best of terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.69,0:34:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我很惊讶 他还推荐了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm surprised he'd recommend me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.52,0:34:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.90,0:34:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我在很多场合下偷听到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I overheard him on plenty of occasions
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.86,0:34:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,其他那些人说 你是最厉害的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}telling other people that you're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.11,0:34:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,被世界上最差的人称之为最好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Called the best by one of the worst on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.49,0:34:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我不确定那是种什么感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure how to feel about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.03,0:34:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 现在麻醉科哪个医生在值班？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, who's the anesthesiologist on call?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.87,0:34:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是本尼特医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That would be Dr. Benet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.50,0:34:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 你能帮我转接到总机吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, of course. Can you connect me with central supply, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.08,0:34:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 总机 - 我是史密斯医生 呼叫本尼特医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Central supply. - Yeah, I'm Dr. Smith, calling for Dr. Benet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.71,0:35:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要给一个美国公民做手术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna be operating on a US citizen
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.21,0:35:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的OR-6用完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we're running low on Neroflurax in OR-6.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.05,0:35:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我会派人送去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll send someone up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.22,0:35:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不用麻烦了 我已经在路上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, don't bother, I'm already on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.31,0:35:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 史密斯医生？- 是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dr. Smith? - That's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.77,0:35:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,OR-6 请在这签字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neroflurax. You sign here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.15,0:35:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我这就给你拿 - 好极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll grab it. - Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.70,0:35:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我还需要你在这盖章\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I also need your stamp right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.70,0:35:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.75,0:35:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Done!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.54,0:35:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.72,0:35:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.01,0:35:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,再来杯伏特加吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another shot of vodka?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.97,0:35:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.44,0:36:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你的口音是哪的？南欧人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your accent, what is it? Meridional?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.31,0:36:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你听得出是南欧的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can tell it's meridional?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.94,0:36:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,现在已经很少听到朗格多克口音了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you don't get to hear the Languedoc much these days
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.49,0:36:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,除了一些偏远的乡下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}except from rural old farts.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.07,0:36:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他们很喜欢他们的奥克西唐语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They love their Occitan.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.24,0:36:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我父母来自巴斯克地区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My parents are from the Basque Country...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.20,0:36:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 比利牛斯山 - 比利牛斯山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- In the Pyrenees. - The Pyrenees.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.20,0:36:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我很了解巴斯克地区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know the Basque country well.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.29,0:36:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么知道的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.04,0:36:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不是有家大型的航空航天工业基地就建造在那吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was a big aerospace industry tucked in all around there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.71,0:36:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,弹头 涡轮直升机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warheads, helicopter turbo shafts...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.47,0:36:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我去过很多地方 中东各地都去过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ran many sorts of parts to all sorts of places in the Middle East.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.51,0:36:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,巴斯克人都很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Basque people are good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.26,0:36:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我很喜欢巴斯克的鸡肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love that poulet basquaise.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.48,0:36:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你会做菜吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cook?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.68,0:36:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.81,0:36:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.06,0:36:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.61,0:36:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他们拿到气体了 我们该上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got the gas. We're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.19,0:36:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他们拿到气体了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got the gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.99,0:36:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他们拿到气体了 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got the gas. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.63,0:37:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你们有谁会说英语吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any of you speak English?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.21,0:37:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.38,0:37:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你们有谁想赚一千欧元吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any of you want to make a thousand euros?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.34,0:37:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,有哇 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.63,0:37:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.32,0:37:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.90,0:37:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,喝一杯怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.82,0:37:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,去你房间里喝怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about your room?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.62,0:37:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是怎么抢到银行的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How the hell did they rob a bank?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.41,0:37:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他们必须得有他的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'd have to have his...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.87,0:37:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他有 他们有 某个人有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He did. They did. Someone did.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.96,0:37:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经通知了所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm calling everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.21,0:37:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,在我查清这件事之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until I figure out what's going on,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.84,0:37:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你注意一下有没有奇怪的事发生 好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}be on the look out for anything strange. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.51,0:37:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.38,0:37:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,打电话给飞行员 咱们离开这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call the pilot. Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.85,0:37:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能起飞 太晚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't take off. It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.31,0:38:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望在规则允许范围内起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to be on the wheels up the minute regulations allow.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.56,0:38:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.65,0:38:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,请随意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, make yourself comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.95,0:38:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你请随意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you make yourself comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.20,0:38:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,脱下衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get undressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.51,0:38:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,请系好安全带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seatbelts, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.36,0:38:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,3个女孩穿一样的衣服抢银行 没人知道谁是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three girls dressed the same to rob a bank so no one knows who's who.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.36,0:38:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你是在问我还是在跟我说话？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you asking me or telling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.82,0:38:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你看 我不明白的一件事是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, the thing I can't figure out is
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.32,0:39:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你们当中为什么有一个不来 错过这一切的乐趣？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why one of you stays behind and misses out on all the fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.78,0:39:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,在《三个火枪手》里 其实是4个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In The Three Musketeers, there were really four.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.83,0:39:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们中必须留下一个 看着你亲爱的老爹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of us had to stay behind and look after dear old dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.79,0:39:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 我不这么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, I don't think that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.71,0:39:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你们可以把他五花大绑的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could have left him tied up in the boot.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.67,0:39:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我们比三个火枪手更聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we're smarter than the Three Musketeers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.46,0:39:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你说他"老" 那就说明你不聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not that smart if you're calling him "old."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.55,0:39:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 滚 不能在这停车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, jerk-off! You can't park here!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.56,0:39:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我去换气罐 然后在这等你们 好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll swap the tanks and we meet back here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.19,0:39:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 咱们开工吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.31,0:40:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你 你在干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you! What you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.56,0:40:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我来换新气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you fresh smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.19,0:40:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,但是有人刚换过了啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the guy just changed the tanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.07,0:41:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那气体都过期了 这标签上有警告的 看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's expired. There's a warning right on the label. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.20,0:41:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他身体不舒服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wasn't feeling well.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.66,0:41:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,能把钥匙给我吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you give me the key?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.34,0:42:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.01,0:42:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,滚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.55,0:43:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我去弄指纹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I get the fingerprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.80,0:43:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我放哨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll keep an eye out.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.64,0:43:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来 帮我一下 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, help me. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.35,0:43:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,就这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.41,0:43:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们都晕过去了 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They're all out. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.29,0:44:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.49,0:44:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 宝贝 要来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, baby, it's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.41,0:44:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我进去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.66,0:44:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,希望这号码是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope the transfer code works.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.25,0:44:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们会知道的 好 试试看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna find out. All right. Let's try.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.32,0:45:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,可以了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.36,0:45:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好 稳住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.62,0:45:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好 都妥了 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes! All good. Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.28,0:45:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,快离开这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.09,0:45:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.84,0:45:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他去哪了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the hell is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.74,0:45:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.83,0:46:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,让女士们在阴暗的角落里等着 可不是什么好事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not nice to keep ladies waiting alone in a dark alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.54,0:46:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你指的是哪些女士 告诉她们我在路上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever those ladies are, tell them I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.54,0:46:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.93,0:46:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你早该给我钥匙的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you should have just given me the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.14,0:46:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他在哪？- 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where is he? - I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.01,0:46:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他去喝茶了还是怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he drinking tea or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.14,0:46:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么耽误了这么久？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.06,0:46:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,有几个孩子需要我哄睡着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was a couple of babies I had to put to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.40,0:46:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,该死 看来这些孩子又醒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit! Seems some of the babies just woke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.11,0:46:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,而且他们看起来都很暴躁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they look cranky.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.53,0:46:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.54,0:46:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,在这等我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait for me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.37,0:46:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都别碰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And don't touch anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.22,0:46:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.43,0:46:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他要去哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he going?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.39,0:47:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 安娜 让车停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shit! - Anna, stop the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.89,0:47:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他说什么都别碰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said don't touch anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.64,0:47:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 他可以的 他可以的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, he's got this. He's got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.28,0:47:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 吉娜 - 我不知道我能否信任这个人 安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gina! - I don't know if I trust this guy, Anna!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.95,0:47:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.12,0:47:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我觉得咱们现在该踩刹车了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I think we should hit the brakes now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.70,0:47:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不 他说了什么都别碰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he said don't touch anything. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.04,0:47:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anna!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.51,0:47:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,停车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.93,0:47:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,安娜 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anna, do it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.68,0:47:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不能 - 我可以试试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't do it! - I can try.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.89,0:47:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,踩刹车 那门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit the brakes! The gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.06,0:47:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.91,0:47:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 坐稳了 - 天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hold on tight. - Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.03,0:48:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.12,0:48:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.33,0:48:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要迟到了 我爸爸不喜欢我迟到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're late. My dad hates it when I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.80,0:48:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在等什么 都早上6点了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we waiting for? It's almost 6:00 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.67,0:48:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,机长在路上了 尤里先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the captain's on his way, Mr. Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.84,0:48:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们等条件一允许就起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be off as soon as regulations permit.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.51,0:48:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.65,0:48:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.98,0:48:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好 尤里先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, Mr. Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.57,0:48:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.03,0:48:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你的飞行员 马丁内机长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm your pilot, Captain Martinet.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.99,0:48:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,代替盖东机长的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Guesdon's replacement.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.32,0:48:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.20,0:48:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,真尴尬 我以为他跟你说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, this is embarrassing. I'd assumed that he told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.16,0:48:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他病了 食物中毒 牡蛎 我记得他是这么说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, he's sick. Food poisoning. Oysters, I believe he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.04,0:48:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,打电话给他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.68,0:49:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 尤里先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Mr. Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.89,0:49:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说你病了 盖东\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm told you are sick, Guesdon.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.39,0:49:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 牡蛎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, oysters.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.56,0:49:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,有个飞行员来替你了 是你让他来的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pilot who has come in your stead, you vouch for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.15,0:49:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我特别推荐他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I highly recommend him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.41,0:49:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个很好的飞行员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is a decorated pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.83,0:49:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 祝你好起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, well, feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.08,0:49:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.50,0:49:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望可以尽快起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to be in the air as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.75,0:49:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会尽全力的 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We shall do our very best, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.52,0:50:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我是机长 我们可以起飞了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the captain speaking, we are cleared for take-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.03,0:50:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好 天空之星669\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, Air Star 669.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.99,0:50:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,请等候起飞指令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please wait for take-off clearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.83,0:50:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,要喝点什么吗 尤里先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like something to drink, Mr. Yuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.41,0:50:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,香槟？橙汁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Champagne? Orange juice?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.46,0:50:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那个 香槟吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, well, champagne is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.87,0:50:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,香槟 马上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Champagne, coming right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.63,0:50:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,走开 就留我们俩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave us. Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.60,0:50:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你的香槟 尤里先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your champagne, Mr. Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.35,0:50:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.56,0:50:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你还需要别的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.23,0:50:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,对 让机长抓紧起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, tell the pilot to get a move on
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.90,0:50:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,然后过来陪我喝酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then come and keep me company.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.74,0:50:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.37,0:50:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,电路板检查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Electrical board checked,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.00,0:50:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,阻尼器检查 操作器检查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}yaw dampers on and operating.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.58,0:50:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,方向舵微调检查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rudder trimmer checked.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.59,0:51:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了就能起飞了 机长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready when you are, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.09,0:51:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,前往主跑道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Proceed to main runway.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.13,0:51:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好 我是机长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, this is the captain speaking again.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.76,0:51:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在在3号跑道 准备起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are third in line for take-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.76,0:51:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,请系好安全带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please fasten your seat belts.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.10,0:51:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将马上升空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should be in the air momentarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.68,0:51:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,终于\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.40,0:51:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.43,0:51:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.06,0:51:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.14,0:52:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,3-1-0-5\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}3-1-0-5.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.40,0:52:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.20,0:52:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,天空之星669\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Air Star 669.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.41,0:52:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,请前往主跑道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please make your way to the main runway.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.83,0:52:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,等候跑道清理再起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And wait to be cleared for take-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.41,0:52:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 空中交通管制台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Air Traffic Control.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.75,0:52:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 等等 我们有警报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, hang on. We have an alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.17,0:52:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是保险丝烧断了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's probably just a blown fuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.21,0:52:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是保险丝烧断了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably just a blown fuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.55,0:52:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你还坐在那张该死的椅子上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's no wonder you're still in that bloody chair!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.92,0:52:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,天空之星669呼叫塔台 我们必须…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Air Star 669 to tower. We're gonna have to run...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.68,0:52:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,搞定了 下飞机吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're good. Let's get off this plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.72,0:52:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,天空之星669呼叫塔台…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Air Star 669 to tower...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.18,0:52:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是塔台 收到吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tower to Air Star 669, do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.14,0:52:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,重复 收到吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I repeat, do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.36,0:52:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.16,0:52:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,塔台呼叫天空之星669 请保持原位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tower to Air Star 669, hold your position!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.25,0:53:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,尤里先生 你那边还好吗？尤里先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Yuri! Everything okay in there? Mr. Yuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.84,0:53:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.22,0:53:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你的朋友吉娜聊过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was talking to your friend Gina.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.81,0:53:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,在巴斯克地区有一个巨大的 航空航天工业基地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a huge aerospace industry in the Pays Basque region.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.43,0:53:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.64,0:53:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,在比利牛斯山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the Pyrenees.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.15,0:53:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,别管了 当我没说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry. Never mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.61,0:53:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,立刻呼叫保安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call security immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.78,0:53:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,别说迟到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.95,0:53:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么能迟到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can you be late?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.41,0:53:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你是什么特种兵？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of Special Forces were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.83,0:53:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你在哪 爸爸？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.16,0:53:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 现在很复杂 儿子 我们被困住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, there's been a complication, son. We're trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.58,0:53:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在在货物区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in the main compartment cargo area.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.21,0:53:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你有办法让我们逃出去吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have any idea how to get us out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.64,0:53:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你是面朝着前轮的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you towards the front wheel?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.51,0:53:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 是货物区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, it's the main cargo hatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.78,0:54:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,停下飞机 重复 停下飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop the plane! I repeat, stop the plane!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.08,0:54:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,从后面爬上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Climb in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.00,0:54:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你为我数数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna need you to count for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.75,0:54:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我数到5 你就跳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I'm going to count to five and you're going to jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.29,0:54:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你说跳是什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean, jump?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.42,0:54:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？不 我们不能跳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? No! We can't jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.17,0:54:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Junior!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.31,0:54:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 5 - 5\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Five! - Five!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.85,0:54:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 4 - 4\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Four! - Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.35,0:54:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 3 - 3\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Three! - Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.23,0:54:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 2 - 2\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Two! - Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.86,0:54:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 1 - 1\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- One! - One!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.89,0:55:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,有多严重？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How bad is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.31,0:55:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,非常严重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's really bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.81,0:55:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,用丝巾 用力按住伤口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take the scarf and put pressure on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.48,0:55:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 我们需要医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not working, we need a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.44,0:55:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们不能甩掉这些人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we don't outrun these guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.69,0:55:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还需要一个非常好的律师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're gonna need a bloody good lawyer too.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.20,0:55:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,塔台呼叫天空之星669 你们要撞机了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tower to Air Star 669, you are going to crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.87,0:55:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,收到吗？669 收到吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you copy? 669, do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.45,0:55:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,重复 你们要撞机了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I repeat, you are going to crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.16,0:55:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要立即停止引擎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to stop the engine right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.87,0:55:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 醒醒 - 如果你们听见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wake up! - If you hear me,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.50,0:55:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要立刻拉下紧急刹车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you need to pull the emergency brake!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.42,0:55:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,就是你右边的把手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the trigger on your right.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.84,0:55:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对 对 我看见了 - 现在就拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, yeah, I see it. - Do it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.19,0:56:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她在抽搐 - 我们怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She's convulsing! - What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.82,0:56:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你们抱紧她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.54,0:56:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看见那栋楼了吗 儿子？- 看见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You see the building, Junior? - I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.59,0:56:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好 飞机会动 但楼不会动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, planes tend to move, buildings tend to stand still.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.42,0:56:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我就是这么想的 - 不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's what I'm counting on. - No, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.84,0:56:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道你在想什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.30,0:56:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 然后呢？- 我很讨厌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And? - I hate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.52,0:56:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 老天… - 怎么会？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Holy... - What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.16,0:57:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,身份不明的汽车 刚进入了主要过道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The unidentified vehicle has just entered the main terminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.01,0:57:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.77,0:57:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frank!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.94,0:58:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好 稳住 - 好 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, hold on. - Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.11,0:58:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你得帮帮她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.48,0:58:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,别看我 我这部分已经完成了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't look at me. I did my part.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.82,0:58:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我送你们去了那 也回来了 现在 把解药给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you there and back. Now, give me the antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.36,0:58:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frank!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.45,0:58:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,她已经流干血了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She can bleed out for all I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.70,0:58:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Junior!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.82,0:58:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,交易一旦达成 就不会再变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once the deal is set, the deal doesn't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.70,0:58:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,交易内容是 现在我该拿解药了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The deal was my time for the antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.04,0:58:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,根本没有解药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no antidote!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.33,0:58:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.33,0:58:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不过是水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just water in the vial.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.88,0:58:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他酒里什么都没放 我们骗你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing in his beer. We made it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.05,0:58:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说他不会死咯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So he's not gonna die?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.46,0:58:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不会是被毒死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not from poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.30,0:58:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 给我拿点布条和水过来 好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be a dear and get me some rags and water, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.77,0:58:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,看 子弹还在那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, the bullet is still in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.60,0:58:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们不弄出来 血就止不住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we don't get it out and the bleeding doesn't stop
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.02,0:58:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,她会死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she is gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.44,0:58:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我们在来的路上已经浪费了足够多的时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, we've wasted enough time getting here already.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.31,0:59:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都说好了 不去找医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all agreed. No doctors.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.02,0:59:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 我们不能让她死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, we can't just let her die.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.69,0:59:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道那样会很危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We knew it would be dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.94,0:59:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好 不找医生 咱们自己帮她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, no doctors. Let's help her ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.74,0:59:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,能把那瓶子递给我吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you pass me that bottle, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.95,0:59:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.58,0:59:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, you can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.41,0:59:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 儿子 这是让我提神的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, son. It's focus for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.58,0:59:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好 水来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, here's the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.29,0:59:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, thanks, love.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.96,0:59:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,"宝贝"？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Love"?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.55,0:59:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 她来自比利牛斯山 巴斯克区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, she's from Pays Basque. Pyrenees.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.88,0:59:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 那太好了 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, that's great, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.47,0:59:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,能找点东西把她的腿抬高吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you get something to raise her leg up, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.72,0:59:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,看看能不能找到香水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See if you can find some perfume,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.10,0:59:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,镊子 还有糖之类的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some tweezers and if there's any sugar around.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.97,0:59:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.14,0:59:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你想让我做点什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want me to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.44,0:59:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 从衣服上撕点碎布条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Take the rod off one of those clothes racks
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.02,0:59:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,然后缠在末端\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and wrap this around the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.52,0:59:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,做什么？为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What to do? To do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.98,0:59:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,然后去弄这房子里的蜘蛛网\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And swab all the corners of the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.40,0:59:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,看看能弄到多少蜘蛛网\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See how many cobwebs you can get on there.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.32,0:59:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 蜘蛛网？- 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cobwebs? - S'il vous plait.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.28,0:59:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.96,0:59:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你这辈子处理过很多类似的伤吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You handle a lot of triage in your time as a sales rep?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.67,1:00:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我该怎么说呢 依云山的那些孩子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can I tell you? Those boys at Evian,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.21,1:00:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他们很彪悍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they play rough.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.46,1:00:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以用伏特加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could use the vodka.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.17,1:00:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,别胡闹了 儿子 那是浪费好的伏特加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be ridiculous, son. That's a waste of good vodka.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.34,1:00:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好 听着 她看起来也许昏迷了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, now listen. She may look like she's out cold, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.14,1:00:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,但她还是能感觉到疼痛的 我要你按住她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But she's gonna feel this. I need you to hold her down.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.22,1:00:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好 - 行啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.77,1:00:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 玛利亚 不过这是唯一的办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry about this, Maria, but it is the only way.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.15,1:00:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 找到了吗？- 就…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You got it? - It's...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.03,1:00:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,快点拿蜘蛛网来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry with the cobwebs!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.91,1:00:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.04,1:00:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这有什么用？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that do?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.46,1:00:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,糖能为伤口杀菌 蜘蛛网能凝结伤口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sugar disinfects the wound and cobwebs coagulate the blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.09,1:00:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是克利夫兰医学中心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not exactly the Cleveland Clinic,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.71,1:00:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不过这能让我们在治好她之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it's going to keep her alive
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.30,1:00:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,让她活下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until we get her patched up properly.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.72,1:00:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,用力按住 好吗 儿子？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put some pressure on that, would you, Junior?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.05,1:00:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事了 你没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're okay. Shh, you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.26,1:00:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,今天不会有人死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one's dying today.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.61,1:01:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,看看那是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look who's there.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.69,1:01:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,同样的女孩 不同的衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same girls, different outfits.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.86,1:01:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这是怎么发生的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.36,1:01:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,一秒钟前一切都还正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One second everything is fine,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.11,1:01:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,接着我就从地板上醒来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the next I wake up on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.16,1:01:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,是某种医用麻醉剂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's some kind of medical grade anesthetic.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.70,1:01:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他们换掉了烟雾机的气筒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They switched the tank for the fog machine.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.45,1:01:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白的一点是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One part I can't quite figure out though is
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.83,1:01:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你的女孩为什么要抢劫我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why your girls would rob me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.71,1:01:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,别胡扯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.13,1:01:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说她们还抢劫了图金的银行保险箱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just the same as I heard they robbed Turgin's safe deposit box.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.01,1:01:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能觉得我和这事有关联\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't think I had anything to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.26,1:01:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure what to think.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.26,1:01:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不过好像是有另一个人在跟她们合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it appears that someone else is working with them.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.98,1:01:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我没记错的话 你是认识他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and he know each other, if I recall.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.15,1:01:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是尤里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.19,1:01:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Da.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.07,1:01:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,当然没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.62,1:01:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我会查到底\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get to the bottom of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.87,1:02:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,尤里也被袭击了 又是一个克尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yuri got hit as well. Another Coeur Brise.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.29,1:02:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,非常方便 你不觉得吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awfully convenient, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.71,1:02:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们两个人被你的女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two of us get robbed by your girls
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.17,1:02:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,还有存在于你过去幻觉中的人抢劫了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a friend from your illustrious past.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.67,1:02:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,给我6小时 我会找到他们处理好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me six hours. I'll find them and I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.42,1:02:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.33,1:02:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,破了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are they broken?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.87,1:02:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,还碰到过更糟糕的情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've been worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.71,1:02:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.59,1:02:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.26,1:02:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你爸爸怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about your dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.09,1:02:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,看来她们在补偿他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like they made it up to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.10,1:03:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经记不清 她们上次是什么时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't remember the last time either of them
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.98,1:03:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,跟付钱的男人同床了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}slept in the same bed as the men who pay them.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.15,1:03:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他应该没付钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think he paid.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.94,1:03:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.90,1:03:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,还有别的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something else?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.15,1:03:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.99,1:03:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我想感谢你为我们做的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted to thank you for what you've done for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.16,1:03:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起毒药的事我骗了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry I lied to you about the poison.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.75,1:03:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,要不先为一开始绑架我爸爸道个歉？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about being sorry you kidnapped my father in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.88,1:03:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那我也很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry about that, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.13,1:03:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,利用你爸爸是我的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was wrong for me to use your father,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.26,1:03:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,而且利用你也是我的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it was wrong for me to use you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.30,1:03:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,大错特错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.22,1:03:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我们的交易完成了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think our deal is done.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.93,1:03:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.94,1:03:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你想不想知道我接下来要做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you want to know what I'm going to do next?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.78,1:03:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I have a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.91,1:04:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我说的是将来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm talking about the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.20,1:04:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我说说将来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me about the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.17,1:04:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我会完成我们开始的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to finish what we started.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.64,1:04:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么会被卷进来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you get caught up in all of this?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.52,1:04:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我来自一个贫穷的小村庄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I come from an impoverished village.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.48,1:04:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,酒精和毒品杀死了那些枪都杀不死的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drinking and drugs killed the people that guns didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.20,1:04:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我12岁时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then when I was 12,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.41,1:04:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我从工作的工厂回到家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came home from the factory where I worked
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.50,1:04:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我妈妈把我介绍给一个衣冠整洁的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and my mother introduced me to a man in a very nice suit.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.17,1:04:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,卡拉索夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Karasov.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.92,1:05:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他说我可以去温暖的地方 为他工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said I could come and do work for him in warm places.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.35,1:05:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他会给我食物和衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He would give me food and clothes
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.18,1:05:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,把我介绍给别的人赚钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and introduce me with men for money.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.10,1:05:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我看着我妈 她说没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I looked at my mom and she said it was okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.02,1:05:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,"好 去吧"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Yeah, go."
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.24,1:05:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我就去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.74,1:05:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不久之后我才发现 她把我卖给了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't until later that I found out that she sold me to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.91,1:05:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,才500美元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For $500.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.33,1:05:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus, Anna.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.88,1:05:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得她起码应该要600 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think she could have gotten $600, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.59,1:05:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你不需要这样做的 你知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't need to do this, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.47,1:05:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是可以离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can still walk away.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.52,1:05:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,如果现在收手 我所经历的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we stop now, it will have been for nothing,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.98,1:05:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,都会变成徒劳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}everything I went through.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.36,1:05:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道被当做垃圾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what it feels like
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.28,1:05:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么感觉吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to be thought of as trash?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.57,1:06:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道他会杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll kill you, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.41,1:06:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不会有任何犹豫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.21,1:06:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,就像伯爵对火枪手说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like the Count said to his Musketeers,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.92,1:06:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,"我奋斗一生不是为了害怕死亡的"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I don't cling to life sufficiently to fear death."
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.69,1:07:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 该走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad. Time to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.28,1:07:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,真的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.49,1:07:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不好意思 女士们 - 呣 呣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Excuse me, ladies. - Mmm. Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.47,1:07:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道她们在干另一件活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know they're doing another job.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.76,1:07:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,对 对付俄国犯罪团伙老大 是个自杀式任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, taking on a Russian crime lord is more of a suicide mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.06,1:07:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,想像一下做那种事以后 你的生活会变得多么糟糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imagine how horrible your life has to be to try something like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.06,1:07:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我在糟糕的地方 见过很多不好的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen some horrible things in some horrible places.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.60,1:08:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,被卖作妓女 死亡是唯一的出路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Being sold into prostitution with death as your only out.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.27,1:08:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那才是最糟糕的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's about as bad as it gets.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.49,1:08:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是 你打算怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The question is, what are you gonna do about it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.45,1:08:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.53,1:08:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这车上又没别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no one else in the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.03,1:08:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我不用做任何事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.95,1:08:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,送你回家 把车扔掉换上直升机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna drop you home, ditch the car at a chopper,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.00,1:08:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,去巴黎待一段 等风头过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}go to Paris for a bit until things cool down, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.25,1:08:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来不像我养大的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That doesn't sound like the man I raised.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.00,1:08:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.75,1:08:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 别太过分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, stay within the lines,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.01,1:08:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,注意所有细节 那才是我们这样的人该做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}watch everything play out, that's exactly what a fobbit would do.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.43,1:08:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我这辈子都只想做正确的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, my entire life, I've tried to do the right thing, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.72,1:08:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我不是你这样的间谍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I wasn't a spy like you,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.01,1:08:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,但我为那蠢货工作过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I served that fool.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.10,1:08:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,可我得到了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did it get me?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.60,1:08:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我完全不应得的下场 这是你自己说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit I didn't deserve. You said it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.28,1:08:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,但这不代表你不应该做正确的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't mean you stop doing the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.67,1:09:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,到了巴黎给我寄张明信片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send me a postcard from Paris.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.58,1:09:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 爸爸？- 你好 弗兰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dad? - Hello, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.92,1:09:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,别跟我说你听不出我的声音 又没隔多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't tell me you don't recognize my voice. It hasn't been that long.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.29,1:09:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.46,1:09:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我想做个交易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I want to make a deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.30,1:09:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你有我要的人 准确来说是三个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have some people I want, three of them to be exact,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.01,1:09:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,而我有你要的东西 来吧 问声好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I have someone you want. Go ahead, say hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.43,1:09:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,开车离开 无论你在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drive away. Wherever you are,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.60,1:09:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,直接走…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just drive away...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.72,1:10:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸… 让他接电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad... Put him back on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.98,1:10:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他现在在休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he's resting now
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.60,1:10:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,而且说实话 我觉得 他给你的这个建议很不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and frankly, I think he's giving you bad advice.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.02,1:10:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,要是他出任何事…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything happens to him...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.52,1:10:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么？要杀了我？得了吧弗兰克 我了解你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll what? Kill me? Come on, Frank. I know you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.49,1:10:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个好士兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were a good soldier.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.95,1:10:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你要做好士兵该做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you'll do what a good soldier always does.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.95,1:10:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你得服从命令 所以仔细听好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll follow the orders. So listen to me very closely.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.49,1:10:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你想再见到你爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you ever wish to see your father alive again,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.91,1:10:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,就完全按照我说的做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'll do exactly what I say.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.04,1:10:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,狗日的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.47,1:10:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 大型的黑色SUV - 驾驶员呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A big, black SUV. - Occupants?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.79,1:11:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,就不能别插手？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couldn't stay away?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.95,1:11:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,有新交易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a new deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.08,1:11:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为你说你从不…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you said you never...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.16,1:11:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那是在他抓走我爸爸之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was before he took my dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.83,1:11:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我之所以掺和进来 就是为了你和我爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I'm in this shit because of you and so is my dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.00,1:11:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,所以不管你同不同意 我们都要去见卡拉索夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So whether you agree or not we're going to see Karasov
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.05,1:11:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,现在马上带着账本到他的游艇上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on his yacht right now with the ledger.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.30,1:11:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我之前帮了你一个忙 我现在要你帮我一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was all for you, now I need you to do one for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.84,1:11:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有的选择吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do we have a choice?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.14,1:11:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.18,1:11:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.39,1:11:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不要再耍花招 不要再说废话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more games. No more bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.69,1:11:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,吉娜在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Gina?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.52,1:11:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,她走了 回家人身边了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She left. Back to her family.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.57,1:11:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,别骗我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't lie to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.65,1:11:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,卡拉索夫以为我们只有3个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Karasov assumes that there is only three of us
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.57,1:11:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,而那就是他要找的 你不觉的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that's what he is looking for. Don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.15,1:11:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们总是把一个人分开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is why we always kept someone separate.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.70,1:11:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这样我们谁都走不了 那就是我们的交易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So one of us could get away. That was our deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.37,1:11:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,去把你爸爸救回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get your father back.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.12,1:12:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎回来 女孩们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome back, girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.96,1:13:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好久不见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.26,1:13:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,还不够久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not long enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.05,1:13:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,还在为之前的事生气？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still upset about what happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.55,1:13:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,对 有一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little bit, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.80,1:13:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为你这种约翰·韦恩一样的人 会把一切都放下呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you John Wayne types just let it roll off your back.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.97,1:13:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那是过去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was the old days.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.77,1:13:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们会怀恨在心 而且必定复仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we hold grudges and get revenge.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.27,1:13:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,为了什么复仇？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Revenge for what?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.56,1:13:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你那辆车专门改装过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That car of yours is a real step up
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.36,1:13:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,就是用来武装押运的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from driving a military convoy truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.19,1:13:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是自找的 弗兰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, you brought this on yourself, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.07,1:13:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你排里的每个人都不干净 他们可是赚了很多钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone in your platoon played ball, they made a lot of money.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.03,1:13:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你带着剩下的钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would have been easier
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.32,1:13:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,直接离开事情会简单得多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you just went along with the rest, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.16,1:13:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是去赚钱 我是去打仗的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't there to make money. I was there to fight a war.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.20,1:13:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会跟你这样的人做生意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't play ball with people like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.42,1:13:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我可没法评价你的国家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I can't speak to the arrangements
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.13,1:13:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,如何使用军事手段达成目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your country's military makes to get jobs done.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.67,1:13:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是很庆幸从中获益的也有我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just happy I was on the side that profited from it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.67,1:14:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我只希望你遭到报应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, let's just hope you get what's coming to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.73,1:14:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,乔 安娜 玛利亚 很高兴你们能加入我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Qiao, Anna, Maria, glad you could join us.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.61,1:14:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸爸在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's my dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.98,1:14:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你们谁把账本带来了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did one of you bring the ledger?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.37,1:14:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 我爸爸在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now where's my dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.00,1:14:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我说… - 我听到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I said... - I heard you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.89,1:14:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该有计划吧 儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I assume you have a plan, Junior.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.90,1:15:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.99,1:15:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还想问你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You tell us.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.78,1:15:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.95,1:15:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你召集开会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You called the meeting.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.99,1:15:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么都没召集\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't call anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.37,1:15:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,别废话了 你这儿什么情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut this shit. What's this about?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.95,1:15:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,首先 我找到了从你手里偷东西的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, for one, I found the people who stole from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.08,1:15:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 他就站在那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. And he's right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.00,1:15:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我已经受够了 你们在那指控我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I'm getting pretty sick of you both accusing me
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.67,1:15:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,做了我没有做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of something I didn't do.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.79,1:15:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,实际上 我把这些人带到这来 是为了杀死他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As a matter of fact, I brought these people here to kill them.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.79,1:15:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,他撒谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's lying.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.50,1:15:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈谁啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.80,1:15:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我是安娜 为他工作的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Anna and I work for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.01,1:15:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,他让我抢劫你 于是我去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He told me to rob you and I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.68,1:15:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们叫你来是因为你的钱在他那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We called you here because he has your money.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.81,1:15:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,让她说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let her talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.56,1:15:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不然我们不可能回来这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no way we're taking the fall for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.44,1:15:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,因为是他抢劫了你们 不是我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause he robbed you. Not us.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.57,1:15:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,满嘴胡言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lying bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.36,1:15:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,让他给你看 让他把银行账户给你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have him show you. Ask him to show you the bank account.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.49,1:15:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不会给任何人看任何东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not showing anybody shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.36,1:15:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,都是老朋友了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been friends for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.45,1:15:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你应该让我看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you should.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.17,1:15:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你会看到每一分钱都在他…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll see he has every penny.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.67,1:16:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.75,1:16:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是你计划的一部分吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not part of your plan, this, is it, Junior?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.52,1:16:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我今天早上检查过账户 我只有1亿2000万\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I checked the account this morning. I have just over 120 million.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.19,1:16:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我会放下枪 把那边的平板拿过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna lower my gun. Grab that tablet right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.86,1:16:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我把账户给你 你自己看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show you the account. You're gonna see for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.90,1:16:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个好的开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a fair start.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.20,1:16:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,对 宝贝 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, baby. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.96,1:16:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.31,1:16:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.10,1:17:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.15,1:17:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,多谢你的密码 混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for the code, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.36,1:17:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.57,1:17:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,1亿2000万 就像我说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}$120 million. Just as I said.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.12,1:17:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.16,1:17:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.63,1:17:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,谁说没钱的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't have the money, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.80,1:17:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你做了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell did you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.93,1:17:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,完全按照你的吩咐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly what you told me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.72,1:17:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我要撕碎你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna rip you up.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.02,1:17:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.10,1:17:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,玛利亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maria!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.11,1:17:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.38,1:18:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.42,1:18:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,和你的钱说再见吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say goodbye to your money.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.34,1:18:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你能把小船放下发动起来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think you can untie the boat and get it started?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.68,1:18:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我尽量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll try!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.90,1:18:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.45,1:18:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你的计划是什么 儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the plan, Junior?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.57,1:18:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我挡住他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll hold them off.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.66,1:18:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们2分钟后在小船上碰头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We meet back on the boat in two minutes!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.96,1:18:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 能给我4分钟吗 - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you give me four? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.92,1:18:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,火力掩护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cover fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.92,1:18:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是开玩笑吗 你怎么枪都不带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you got to be kidding. Why do you never carry a gun?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.17,1:18:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你就不能别找事了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ever think about being less critical?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.80,1:18:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.89,1:19:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好 听我倒数 3 2 1 走 走 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. On my count! Three, two, one! Go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.70,1:19:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.96,1:19:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.88,1:20:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You jerk!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.05,1:20:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.94,1:20:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,吉娜 不 不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gina! No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.78,1:20:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay with me!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.36,1:20:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,没事了 没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.21,1:20:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持住 坚持住 坚持住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay with me, stay with me. Stay with me, stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.63,1:20:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 弗兰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.96,1:20:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.71,1:20:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 别死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm sorry. - Stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.14,1:21:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,再快点 过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faster! Go here!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.06,1:21:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 上快艇 - 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get on the jet ski! - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.90,1:21:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,抓稳了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.78,1:21:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.66,1:21:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.16,1:21:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frank!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.92,1:21:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frank!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.57,1:22:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.42,1:23:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该在有机会的时候加入我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should have joined me when you had the chance, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.15,1:24:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.28,1:24:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这一切都是你设计的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You set this up.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.53,1:24:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你把见面安排在游艇上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You called the meeting on the yacht
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.82,1:24:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,并确保我父亲被绑架了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and made sure my dad was kidnapped,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.03,1:24:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那样一来 我就会帮你把剩下的事情做完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I'd be here to help you finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.08,1:24:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,呆着别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay where you are!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.45,1:25:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你要杀了我 因为我是最后的牺牲品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now you're going to shoot me because I'm a loose end.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.08,1:25:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,剩下的唯一一个 知道你罪行的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last person left to name you for your crimes.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.09,1:25:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我在找到办法之前无法停手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't stop until I get all the way out.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.63,1:25:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是 如果你要杀了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The question is, if you were supposed to kill me then,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.05,1:25:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那你之前为何救我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why did you save my life?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.05,1:25:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,别说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.60,1:25:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,求你别说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.48,1:25:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你的朋友们因你而死 安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your friends died for you, Anna.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.90,1:25:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我也愿意为她们而死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like I would have died for them.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.24,1:25:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我只希望你这么做是值得的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just hope whatever you got out of it was worth it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.31,1:25:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.98,1:26:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd better go.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.94,1:26:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.53,1:26:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.87,1:27:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我再告诉你 但这不会有什么不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you again, but it won't be any different.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.16,1:27:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我为依云水工作 我是销售员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I work for Evian. I was delivering water.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.62,1:27:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我到了那里 发现那里到处是尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I get there, there are dead bodies everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.63,1:27:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,然后两个家伙乘着快艇和摩托艇出现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then two guys roar off on a speedboat and a jet ski.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.01,1:27:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这个人呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.09,1:27:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,在船上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the boat, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.47,1:27:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 摩托艇呢？- 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And the jet ski? - I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.05,1:27:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不管他是谁 他都是嫌疑人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because whoever he was, he will be tried for murder.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.43,1:27:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我不能告诉你我不知道的事情 我没见过那家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I can't tell you what I don't know. I didn't see the guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.35,1:27:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,说得真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How convenient.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.56,1:27:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我们结束了 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess we're done here, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.36,1:27:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,如果没有 那就给我个什么罪名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause if not, then please charge me with something,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.36,1:27:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,否则你就是在浪费我们的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}otherwise you're wasting both our times.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.70,1:27:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can go.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.03,1:27:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 警官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Inspector.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.70,1:27:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very good of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.45,1:27:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.77,1:28:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,在警察局待了12小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twelve hours in a police station.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.89,1:28:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道那对我来说有多丢脸吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know how humiliating that is for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.44,1:28:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,为何你不告诉我你想回去 好好喝一杯呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you tell me all about it over a good bottle of wine?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.06,1:28:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你总算说了句聪明话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finally you say something smart.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.21,1:29:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mama!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.71,1:30:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你见到她们 不要犹豫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you ever meet them, don't hesitate.
